<div data-cgap-sector="Sawmills, Pulp &amp; Paper" data-cgap-term="sawmill"></div><p class="lead">A sawmill runs on equipment that does not forgive a slip: log decks that roll, debarkers that grab, band saws, chippers and a planer mill full of chains and sorters. A paper mill adds steam, nip points on rolls that move faster than anyone can react, and the chemicals that cook the pulp.</p><p>These signs are written for those exact machines and spots, from the log yard to the dry kilns and from the pulper to the winder. Each one is 8x12 aluminum with pre-drilled holes for a guard, rail or machine frame, and it stays readable through sawdust, steam and washdown.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Log yards and log decks</h3><p>Loaders, log decks and the yard traffic around them. 65 signs. Typical spot: Carriage deck and turner arms.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-log-turner-sign-8x12-aluminum">Log Turner</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-log-turner-arm-pin-sign-cgap-w02721-812">Log Turner Arm Pin</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-log-deck-walkway-sign-cgap-c01029-812">Log Deck Walkway</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-log-scanner-heads-sign-cgap-n01434-812">Log Scanner Heads</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Debarkers</h3><p>Drum and ring debarkers, bark conveyors and the platforms above them. 154 signs. Typical spot: Rotor guard access doors and debarker platform.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-ring-debarker-rotor-sign-8x12-aluminum">Ring Debarker Rotor</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-debarker-hold-down-arm-sign-cgap-w05123-812">Debarker Hold Down Arm</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-debarker-gearbox-sign-cgap-c05203-812">Debarker Gearbox</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-debarker-mcc-sign-cgap-n05743-812">Debarker MCC</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Head rig and saw line</h3><p>Band saws, carriages, edgers and trimmers on the main line. 167 signs. Typical spot: Walkways beside the band mill and carriage.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-band-headrig-sign-8x12-aluminum">Band Headrig</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-gang-saw-sign-cgap-w15400-812">Gang Saw</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-resaw-table-edge-sign-cgap-c04194-812">Resaw Table Edge</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-edger-infeed-sign-cgap-n04734-812">Edger Infeed</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Chippers and hogs</h3><p>Chippers, hogs and the chip handling that follows them. 152 signs. Typical spot: Pile perimeter and access roads.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-chip-pile-sign-8x12-aluminum">Chip Pile</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-chipper-knife-bolt-cleaning-sign-cgap-w08326-812">Chipper Knife Bolt Cleaning</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-chip-pile-base-sign-cgap-c05340-812">Chip Pile Base</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-wood-hog-infeed-sign-cgap-n10390-812">Wood Hog Infeed</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Planer mill, sorters and stackers</h3><p>Planers, sorters, stackers and the chains between them. 127 signs. Typical spot: Trimmer saw line and lug chain.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-lumber-trimmer-sign-8x12-aluminum">Lumber Trimmer</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-lumber-sticker-placer-sign-cgap-w00322-812">Lumber Sticker Placer</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-sticker-stacker-hopper-sign-cgap-c05069-812">Sticker Stacker Hopper</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-tray-sorter-sign-cgap-n06619-812">Tray Sorter</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Dry kilns</h3><p>Kiln doors, fans, baffles and the heat inside. 177 signs. Typical spot: Kiln door openings.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-kiln-door-sign-8x12-aluminum">Kiln Door</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-kiln-fan-sign-cgap-w15386-812">Kiln Fan</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-kiln-aisle-sign-cgap-c13552-812">Kiln Aisle</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-dry-kiln-cart-sign-cgap-n14023-812">Dry Kiln Cart</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Paper machines and winders</h3><p>Nip points, dryer sections, reels and winders. 178 signs. Typical spot: Hood doors.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-dryer-hood-sign-8x12-aluminum">Dryer Hood</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-core-winders-sign-cgap-w15375-812">Core Winders</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-dryer-hood-door-sign-cgap-c17424-812">Dryer Hood Door</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-reel-drum-sign-cgap-n23248-812">Reel Drum</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Pulpers, digesters and chemical areas</h3><p>Pulpers, digesters and the chemicals used to make pulp. 232 signs. Typical spot: Mount on or beside the pulper sump pump where workers approach it.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-caustic-soda-fill-station-sign-splash-and-spray-hazard-will-cause-serious-injury-stay-clear-aluminum-12x8-uv-resistant-rust-resistant-by-cgap-safety">Caustic Soda Fill Station</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-recovery-boiler-sign-cgap-w15420-812">Recovery Boiler</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pulper-sump-pump-sign-cgap-c18549-812">Pulper Sump Pump</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-broke-pulper-sign-cgap-n16720-812">Broke Pulper</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What safety signs does a sawmill need?</summary><p>Start at the machines with the worst outcomes: the debarker and log deck, the head rig and saw line, the chipper and hog, and the kilns. Then add lockout reminders at each control station. The Sign Finder lists signs for each one by install point.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for paper machines and winders?</summary><p>Yes, including nip points, jog controls, lockout boards and broke chutes. Search &quot;paper machine&quot; to see them.</p></details><details><summary>Will these hold up to sawdust and steam?</summary><p>Yes. They are rust-resistant aluminum with UV-stable print, and they wipe clean, so they stay readable in dusty and damp mills.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What safety signs does a sawmill need?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Start at the machines with the worst outcomes: the debarker and log deck, the head rig and saw line, the chipper and hog, and the kilns. Then add lockout reminders at each control station. The Sign Finder lists signs for each one by install point."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for paper machines and winders?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including nip points, jog controls, lockout boards and broke chutes. Search \"paper machine\" to see them."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Will these hold up to sawdust and steam?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. They are rust-resistant aluminum with UV-stable print, and they wipe clean, so they stay readable in dusty and damp mills."}}]}</script>